  Section order (cold-visitor flow: hook → reframe → product → proof → offer):
    1. Hero        — hook
    2. Problem     — agitate
    3. Reframe     — the "why" payoff + bridge to the free tool
    4. Free Tools  — PRODUCT (what she can do tonight)
    5. About       — PROOF (founder authority + stats, before any price)
